11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"扬帆云机场怎么样？好用吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"2025 年开业、号称老牌团队新站，Vmess 协议、IEPL 专线、解锁完备、价格亲民，多家评测中上水平、高性价比。据茶波实测电信用户体验更好，移动/联通需挑节点。要平价专线的电信用户可试，先月付，别囤永久套餐。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"扬帆云跑路了吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"未跑路。主域名 yangfan.app 与下单域名均可访问、未被 limbo 等跑路名单收录、2026 年多家评测仍标正常运营。但开业时间短（2025 年）、母站未证实，仍需观察，安心月付即可。节点连不上多是订阅被污染，换官网主副订阅或重取即可。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"扬帆云和奈云是一家吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"无公开证据表明同源。扬帆云与奈云是两家不同的机场，技术方案、客户端都不同，目前没有证据显示它们属于同一团队。认准官方域名别买错。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"扬帆云适合移动/联通用户吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"据茶波实测，扬帆云对电信用户体验更好；移动、联通能用但需要挑节点（部分节点入口带宽不足影响体验）。移动/联通用户建议先月付实测本地哪些节点快再决定。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"扬帆云有优惠码吗？能退款吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"618 期间有年付码 yf6189（6.9 折）、两年付 yf6185（6.5 折）、半年付 lucky9（9 折），但 618 已过、可能失效，以官网当前为准。未见明确无理由退款政策（虚拟商品），务必先月付小额试再续。\"}}]}"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：扬帆云（Yangfan Cloud）是一家 2025 年开业的机场，"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"号称某老牌大机场团队新站"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":"（母站是谁"}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"无公开证据可证实"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":"，别全信营销话术）。先回答最热的——"}],["$","$1","6",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"它没跑路"}]}],["$","$1","7",{"children":"：主域名 "}],["$","$1","8",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"yangfan.app"}]}],["$","$1","9",{"children":" 与下单域名均可访问、未被各大跑路名单收录、2026 年多家评测仍标正常运营。Vmess 协议、公网隧道中转 + IEPL 专线、52 节点、解锁 Netflix/Disney+/ChatGPT/TikTok，价格亲民（¥19.99/100G 起，大档低至 ¥0.071/GB）。但要诚实说：① "}],["$","$1","10",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"据茶波实测它对电信用户更友好"}]}],["$","$1","11",{"children":"，移动/联通需挑节点用；② "}],["$","$1","12",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"节点复用较多"}]}],["$","$1","13",{"children":"（同级套餐同地区基本一个落地）；③ 它有一堆「"}],["$","$1","14",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"永久/不限时套餐」，开业短的新站永久套餐风险偏高、且无明确退款政策，慎买"}]}],["$","$1","15",{"children":"；④ 下单域名是近期新注册的，"}],["$","$1","16",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"域名常换需认准官方最新地址"}]}],["$","$1","17",{"children":"。"}],["$","$1","18",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"结论：电信用户 + 要平价 IEPL 专线、能先月付实测的人可以试；移动/联通先挑节点；所有人都别囤永久"}]}],["$","$1","19",{"children":"。"}]]}],"\n"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","em",null,{"className":"text-[0.95em] text-muted not-italic","children":"未跑路但开业短需观察、母站未证实；电信友好、节点复用多、永久套餐慎买，建议月付"}]}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"my-10 border-rule"}],["$L1b",["$","h2",null,{"id":"先消歧-扬帆云-奈云","className":"mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 border-b border-rule pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight lg:scroll-mt-20","children":"⚠️ 先消歧：扬帆云 ≠ 奈云"}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85",